尾狮公园。回顾此次经历，他们表示感受到了新加坡的魅力，包括其历史、文化和自然风光，“这是一次学习很多东西的宝贵机会”。","tg":{"media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/eQ6EAw7glhe6y_X3yRenp9Ok82uU5htIKLKj6cW10U4RU357xVsh8hE6Lj94HmGGMghoGs4lltZT-XT8Jl8nxx-lAMYrg0533Cnz3nc-bJ4tDl8wa9yaQizCJA26X77pPi5Sp5b-CCGymJfyv5DmTKMYgWExl_UTktqh3EafTz_bqNZcNHMZDwBJCFfnVt7F_42pZwEf4lcHnf1W4gSEaY-e3N4LqY8kQc5UEllRlciBvgUydoto3bKsidlL3jcf6rzbob0dwmoAnCIlKME880m5rbRVco0FEg03SBFXhIJ36CwEXTFO_eY-Sphs1jjwo2zB_lKr8dywoqy0lyJ2CA.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/mb-prW3duHICmTMoUVIr-nhd5JgqMGk5fpJEoplPDIr3KkVOx7LJUjxyt38swh6di59NjBXkkSF8wycdULBuGOo9KCurx2EWRMb5S2vgVK1ZqauQKagJVzS-_YLf3lYxytWXNfVLukawQ93aOuQIRNGWWN9K8t9sYgVsz4KmiSI08FJDyzrCQ-tyve_nQmNF-ohFcxqT_YZCgCUdFF_DeAzOOjfKfLQhczgGmLYV2Sft6XJfoPpawkSvbAJ3QzVe1v80h2ZMHEIppd6ef8xmymt_9ZAlM3yxt8OA_J92qJvWhsyU5UhmgBMnn-RhmvmTrCESzBJialnfDxKnyI4w1A.jpg"}],"views":1640,"views_label":"1.64K","reactions":[{"emoji":"💩","count":12,"label":"12"},{"emoji":"❤","count":3,"label":"3"},{"emoji":"👍","count":1,"label":"1"}],"fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:07:01+08:00"}},{"id":"freechinese:113496","kind":"news","channel":"current","source_id":"freechinese","source_name":"FREE 中文","title":"看这事闹的，本来我都滑走了","summary":"","url":"https://t.me/freechinese/113496","image":{"url":"media/freechinese/113496_1.webp","width":180,"height":320},"published_at":"2026-11-21T17:20:01+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:15:02+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"看这事闹的，本来我都滑走了","tg":{"media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/3371966d97.mp4?token=Tv1SfX1mQUQeIJDYIuVlljSoZy0LPlf3G-bTMhqekWugZXlpXz8pa1jVm3B45N9vv90alXuOTnYZIbOKhZJwfhSqRcquQ3GfHlPWnNgQCJOnGcPsKZnrihfv1Vq0-KgaZGKpfjv3C09o1IkgDi6FdcFXzbRrAWMOBt-KvXACzJJl4TUZyBJYreMbP8FduGP2sn9wnllPanGJTibPcb8FMXeWOxT6XEPpzWeDN_xnQU5fmeyzbpfnoo6PAtG13rMNBSS6u1vQe2cdEWlyj7lHnIRA4Xb4S9y-jpn3Qy_nurPz1IWa70Qy-N8u8Dx5zjOyOj0TgoTVFaLWPb6K29OXHw","preview_url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/vFwLzji7zzVc3iBLtiASmtgk32189mey69nu_FHqjU